          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black mb-4 text-[#4A3728] dark:text-[#F0E6D8]">API <span class="gradient-text">Reference</span></h1>
          <p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-base max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">Programmatic access to TofuPass password and passphrase generation. The API generates server-side and returns plain text. No account or API key required, with language discovery and privacy-preserving rate limits built in.</p>
